<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-YEGOROVA WINS 5-KM WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-YEGOROVA WINS 5-KM WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Lyubov Yegorova won the 5-km classical style women's cross-country race at the Nordic skiing world championships on Sunday in a provisional time of 13 minutes 29.9 seconds.</p>
<p>Russian Yelena Vialbe was second in 13:32.70 and Stefania Belmondo of Italy was third in 13:35.00.</p>
</text>
